<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Hona Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Timoti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Nda ǝn Mbulus a Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Kyagha ɗeleewar ɗaɓa ya a har Mbulus, tǝthlǝnda Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, wurna Faara a tsauka tǝthlǝnda Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. Thlǝnna nda nggi a ɗi pǝr ˈya ndanǝn a fingya aten yibrha ahu fǝrƙǝkafek hu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />A Timoti ka waana. Ngwa furowa Faara na China tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso na Chinǝm nggayirha, a haɗowun fa, tǝ ɗǝɗemnggirha.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fǝr kaali tsawud ƙǝkafek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Usaɗi Faara niya ǝnang taara, ƙǝla ǝnana chichiyina tǝ hura tsahai, nda fǝɗikrha tǝ yanfaara ni naarha ɗal sa in ahu hwan Faara niya ǝnaarha. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ɗalɗi teena hai tǝ aam yidwa a sayidɗi ndǝk nǝm hai, na minna sǝ a na sa ni tǝni lǝghǝtta tǝ wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ɗalɗi teena hai tǝ fǝrƙǝkafekkid wa tǝ hura tal, ƙǝla ǝnana kaghad wa Loyis tǝ muwa Yunis, sǝnɗisǝ nanǝnya tur fǝrƙǝkafekkid ndan ndǝna a ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ tǝ kanglanggirha ahurwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Nanǝn kee niya ɗaloƙǝn in a hǝnangga wad ǝnfǝra tǝ peɗǝnda fǝrona Faara a sayidɗi ɗǝfoni haara teena. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ƙǝsǝr Faara fǝrangwa sǝsǝn hǝreenga ƙǝm wa, amma yi sǝsǝmnda tǝ nggǝmnda tǝ ƙǝs alteena. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Nanǝn kee a shiɗoɗǝ a pǝrang laɓar Chinǝm na fingya wa. A shiɗoɗi wa, ko nanǝn niyi ahu porsǝna ka Ƙǝrǝsti wa. Tǝ sǝsǝmnda fǝrona Faara, nggo fa a sǝsaana tǝ nggi ka a pǝr Laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn, mbǝrsana tǝ sǝsǝmnda Faara <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Faara ndǝn hǝrghangga ƙǝm, ndǝghǝnni wurgha ƙǝm a nagha tsawud nǝm chahal. Əna nǝn ǝnɗiya, mbǝ ka taara ǝna nǝm wa, amma ƙǝsǝr ǝnɗa ni na midghǝn ƙǝtǝm kapa na nda ǝna ƙǝshiirha, ka a kyad nggǝm ndǝghǝn nǝn tǝ nggayidghǝn a ƙǝm ahu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Nanǝnya kyaɗang nda ndǝn ƙǝm a pǝpal ahu ɓad Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso tǝ hǝrkrǝnǝm, ahu ƙǝshiirha ɓa, kalgha sǝsǝmnda mǝrra tǝ ƙǝm kyaɗang ɗǝ kwamana ƙǝm yi yibrha pakwanɗǝ ahu Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Wur Faara nggi a tsawi tǝ pǝr laɓar Faara, tǝthlǝnda, tǝ ƙǝm tǝmalǝmnda yi Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn ya. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Ndǝghǝn ɗa ǝnagha ndǝn niya sǝsaarha ahu porsǝnɗi ya. Amma shiɗewa wa, ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗi niifɗi fǝrni ƙǝkafek a ndǝghǝn tǝ ƙǝm sǝnɗi sǝ nǝn a laf ǝnɗi fǝree nǝn ta farɗa ɗǝ nǝn a wutta ɓa. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Ƙǝsu kwaman tsahadɗa ha kyana tsahoni ha. Ɗalu teena hai a nana tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek fa tǝ nggǝmnda nana tǝghǝn ahu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Tǝ thlarra Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda na ahur nǝm, no naarha laf ƙǝkafekkid Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn tsahoni ha tǝ sammayirha. <verse eid="2TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Ƙǝla sǝnna sǝ, fatakkwaya heu ɓagha ɓa a chehweed Asiya kenda ƙǝsǝra, ko nda Paidjelus tǝ Hamodjenis ni ma winda. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />A kyaɗangga Faara nggayirha Onesiporus heu tǝ wurighǝn ƙǝsǝr nǝn naarha ɓarha thlǝmanna ɓa fǝree kaali. Shiɗangwa ka nani ahu porsǝna wa. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ɓanǝn a Roma ɓa, ƙǝtǝlgha ka kaɗa nggi nǝn waleeghǝn. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Ngwa kyaɗangga Faara nggayirha Onesiporus a fara wudna Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa. Sǝnna sǝ tafad wa ɗeeɗa sǝ kaan ahu sayidɗi nani a Afisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Ka Sodja Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Sa waana Timoti, no kanglang ahu nggayirha fǝrona Faara ahu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Sǝkna fanna tsahangɗi ǝngya fiya ha hangga thlǝgha ndǝn fa. Tsahang ƙǝkafekkini ka fiya ha kanda ƙǝm tsahang nggǝnda fingya ha. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Ƙǝrsu tǝ sǝsaarha tǝ nggi ƙǝla ka sodja Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Ƙǝla sodja Ƙǝrǝsti, a kyang na fadwa hu ǝngya ƙǝshiirha hai wa, ƙǝsǝr a ǝnanna kee mba ǝna ˈya na a mbǝnanggǝn mamnduwa wa. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />A naa niifa a pǝpǝla ɗaarha, a takkwawa ngyakhrha wa mbǝ wal ƙǝnaghǝn wa. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Tǝ huɗaarha ǝnagha targhǝn ngga ndǝghǝnni a ˈwa tǝk mbǝnda ǝnnad hedghǝn mii. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Numo aten ˈya niya thlǝworha. Chinǝm Faara ndǝna a fǝro sǝnda ǝnggini heu ya. <verse eid="2TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />A mbǝɗoɗǝ tǝ ndaarha Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti niifa ni nggǝt nanda ahu turya Ndauda hai thliigha sǝ ahu mǝrra wa. Laɓar ɗani na Mbǝnggǝn niya pǝra ya. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Ƙǝsǝr ka Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn niya pǝra ya, niyi a sǝsaarha ƙǝneegha nda tǝ wuyiwurra ƙǝla tǝ ɗimirha. Amma mbǝ niifa sǝ na mbang ƙǝnang laɓar Faara wa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Tsaunǝn kee ƙǝrǝsɗi tǝ ǝngya heu, ƙǝsǝr ka fingya wurna Faara, tǝna nda fǝrƙǝkafek a Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso hǝrgha nda, wal mamnggirha nda mbuwa ngwalaarha. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Laɓara ni na ƙǝkafek ya: A mǝr ɗǝm tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti nǝm a tsaurha tǝghǝn. <verse eid="2TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />A ƙǝrǝs ɗǝm nǝm a tsau kutǝryirha tǝghǝn. A ngaal ɗǝm ndǝn, nǝn a ngaal ƙǝm. <verse eid="2TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />A mbǝ ƙǝkafek sǝ a fad nǝm wa, ndǝghǝnggi na ƙǝkafek sǝ a fadghǝn, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ kar altenggǝn wa. <verse eid="2TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />No a ɗalang ǝnggini fiya teena ya, ndang kanda ahu thlǝm Faara a malangganda yanda tǝ ndan. Ngaala ƙǝla yanɗiya mbǝ ka ˈyani wa, ƙǝl nǝn sǝɓang fingya ɗǝ na a ka thlǝmaarha hai. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Əno taara ngga a fara kyaɗang na fadwa Faara nǝn a mbǝnang nda, tsawu tǝ taara mbuwana targhǝn shiɗang nda, tǝ ƙǝm tsawu tǝ taara na tsaha ka laɓar ɗa ha mǝmǝl. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />A kyang na fadwa ahu palth nuryirha tǝ ƙǝm mbuwa ngga wa, ƙǝsǝr fingya na a thlǝk tur palth nuryidɗiya na nda tsaurha inggun ma Faara. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Laɓaryindan nǝn weela ɗǝ ƙǝla wundǝrha na hǝlthwud mbuwa ƙǝnda. Himeniyus tǝ Pilitus na nda kee. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Malang nda laɓar ƙǝkafekkirha, na nda a pǝr nggaɓaarha, ndanda thlid mǝrya sǝ ˈwaɗǝ teena tsǝɗa hai; ka tur laɓaryini ya ˈyaɗang fǝrƙǝkafek fingya fa. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Amma ƙǝkafekkid Faara tsauɗǝ ƙǝla ɗǝf sar tǝnda na tǝ feera nanǝn chichireethlee hai tǝ ndaarha, “Sǝn Chinǝm nafiya na yighǝn,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗeleewar Thlǝtta 16:5 </char></note> tǝ ƙǝm, “Fingya na a ndaarha kanda yi Chinǝm ni tǝtani a malang ngganda tar mbǝlfeerha.” <verse eid="2TI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Ahu minda na manggǝn fingya ɓǝya tǝ ɗengya ǝnagha ndan tǝ tǝfasa fingya ƙǝm tǝ wurirha. Fingya ǝnagha nda kanda tǝ ɗǝfrha tǝ ƙǝm tabrha. Ɗengya ǝna nanda tǝ tǝfasa tǝ wurirha ka tar teera, ɗengya ǝna nanda tǝ ɗǝfrha tǝ yi tabrha ka tar hur minda. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />A tsauna kula ǝn ˈyaara, na tsaurha ƙǝla ɗeng tar Faara. Na naarha chahal, nggungwa fa ka turi wa a ǝna taara nǝn tǝ sa ngga. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Kyang fadwa sǝ ma ˈya na ɗimi na mid wundǝlaya. Takku ǝngya kamngga mǝmǝl a ǝnana. Kaɗu fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ nggǝmnda tǝ tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha, tǝ ƙǝm ǝno wutsǝfayirha tǝ fingya na a tǝrang shilee Chinǝm teena tǝ hura chahal. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Niya nggǝr ndaarha no inggun ma laɓar nuryirha, tǝ ngaala kaka na ɓang yanda ɓa wa. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Niifa na a ǝnang taara Chinǝm mbǝ yanda wa, a meyedghǝn tsauɗǝ tǝta a nagha ǝna nggayirha a fiya heu. Tsauɗǝ ƙǝm tǝta a tsahanggǝn fiya ha mǝmǝl aten ƙǝkafekkid laɓar Faara, a ƙǝrǝsgha tǝ fingya na tendan kakrak. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />A nagha tsahadghǝn ha tǝ sammayirha a fingya kargha ƙǝkafek fa. Asǝmha na Faara a kyaarha hurndan hai malang ngganda ɗimiyid ndan sǝn ƙǝkafek nda, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />tǝna huten ndan wutta ɓa hǝrgha nda ma takthler sheetan. Ƙǝsang takthler Sheetan kanda tǝna nda ǝna ˈya na midghǝn.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">A mii ngwala ƙǝshiirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />A sǝnasǝ, Timoti, a mii ngwala ƙǝshiirha na sǝsaarha a naarha sǝ kaan. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ƙǝsǝr na fiya a nggǝm alten ndan kee tǝ nggǝm wuɗǝɓǝla. Na nda naarha taala tǝ tǝrang nda tendan sǝ, na nda ˈyar farha ka ka, tǝ sar fa nggǝtyindan, tǝ yamid usaarha, tǝ ƙǝm mba nda tǝrǝm Faara wa. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Mba nda nggǝm ndan wa, mbǝ chakh ɗimiyirha sǝ wa, na nda nggaɓang nda fiya fa ka ka, mba nda mbang ƙǝsang alten ndan wa, na nda ǝna tar mbǝlfeerha, na nda tsan ˈya na ngga. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Na nda heng nda pashiyi ndan a fa saryi ndan, kala ˈya na nda ǝnaarha mba nda numang wa, na nda lǝlǝgɗa tǝ tǝr alteena, tǝ nggǝmnda mbǝnafa ma Faara. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />A ƙǝshi na nda kyad ndaarha na nda a takkwa Faara, amma kar nda sǝsǝmnda Faara fa na a kyad ndaarha fatakkwaya ni. Ndusu ɗǝ ma tur nafiniya. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Tur nafinani ya na yakh ɗǝrha a minda ki fiyaɗǝ na nda a lǝm nishya fa mbuwa ndǝdǝl ƙǝsang na ɗimiyirha kanda hai, tǝ ƙǝm numad ǝn mbǝlfeeya a ǝna taara tǝ kanda. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Tur nishyini ya yakh nda takkwa weerǝnda tsaharha ha, amma mba nda sǝnang ƙǝkafekkirha hai wa. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Ƙǝla ƙǝtǝm sarang nanda Djenes tǝ Djambres<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nafiniya fa kulaya ni sargha Musa a mbed Firˈauna (Kyarhaɓa 7:11-22) </char></note> Musa ɗǝ, na famalǝmnggini kee ya, sar nda palth ƙǝkafek ƙǝl numad ǝn mbǝlfeerha, fǝrƙǝkafekkid nafiniya nǝghǝn ka kee. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Amma mba nda mbang ɗǝrha ɗǝ inggun tǝ tar nuryid ndan wa. Na fara sǝ ɓana kowunni sǝnang hai, ƙǝla ˈwanǝn katǝrarha hai tǝ nda Djanes tǝ Djambres.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">ˈYa ndana Mbulus a Timoti a ǝnagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Amma sa Timoti sǝnna ˈya tsahang ni fiya ha, tǝ tsawud na, tǝ ˈya na minna a ǝnee. Sǝnna fǝrƙǝkafekkid na tǝ sǝsadna. Sǝnna nggǝmndǝna tǝ ƙǝrǝssǝna. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Sǝnna kaara tǝ sǝsaarha saani fa. Heu sǝnna tur sǝsadɗi saani fa a Antakiya tǝ Ikoniya tǝ Listǝra, amma hǝryed Chinǝm ahurghǝn. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Ƙǝkafek, kala niifa na midghǝn sǝ a ǝna ˈya nǝn na a mbǝnanggǝn Faara tǝ ƙǝm fǝrɗǝ ƙǝkafek a Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, nǝn a taarang sǝsaarha fa a har fiya. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Amma fa mbǝlfeeya tǝ fa nggaɓaya na nda naarha chik sǝbrha ɗǝ. Na nda naarha nggaɓa fiya, kanda ma na fiya naarha nggaɓa kanda. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Amma sa, ɗuwa mbeeɗǝ tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek aten ǝnggini tsaho nanda ha. Sǝnna sǝ nǝghǝn ƙǝkafek tǝ ƙǝm sǝnna nafini tsahowa ha. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Tsahonda Laɓar Faara ha tǝ Peɗǝnda ka sa ngguchit, tǝ ƙǝm fǝron nda sǝnda yi wal hǝrǝkrha ahu fǝrƙǝkafek a Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Laɓar Faara heu kyaghǝn ɓa a mii Faara, tǝ ƙǝm nǝghǝn ngga a ǝna taara nǝm sǝ ahu tsahang ƙǝkafekkid laɓar Faara fiya ha, a yanang nggǝm fiya aten ˈya ǝna nanda mbuwa ngga. Laɓar Faara nǝghǝn ngga ahu tangsang nda fiya a mbǝrha kyalth nanda sa hai tǝ ƙǝm tsahanggǝn fiya ha a ǝna ˈya nda kamngga. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Kwaman Faara niya na a ngwanggǝn nafighǝn fa a ǝna tarya nda heu na ngga na midghǝn a ǝna nda.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />A mbed Faara tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso, tǝ ngwang kumarha a nafiya ɓalgha tǝ yibrha fa tǝ mǝrya, a wudɗa ɓa ka ɓagha ǝna kutǝryirha, niya ndorha: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Puru laɓar Faara. Nggo fa a pǝr laɓar ɗa na ahu sayidɗi na mid fiya sǝ tǝ sayidɗi mbuwa na mid ndan sǝ. Ƙǝrsu lumu fiya fa, yanang kanda, fǝrang kaali nafiwa tǝ tsaharha ha ngga. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ƙǝsǝr na fara ɓayi ɓawa na fiya nggǝr kang thlǝmaarha tsahad ƙǝkafek fa. Na nda a takkwa nggǝmnda hur ndan tǝ ƙǝm na nda kaɗa famalǝmngya a pǝrang ˈya nda kanda na mindan sǝkrha. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Mbǝ mid fiya sǝ a kang thlǝmaarha ƙǝkafekkid laɓar Faara fa wa. A meyedghǝn na nda kang thlǝmaarha asǝɗaya fa mbuwa ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Amma ƙǝsu altenwa ngga, ƙǝrsu tǝ sǝsaarha, puru laɓar Faara, ǝno taara heu fǝrona Faara. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Niya pǝro palthɗi ya, ƙǝsǝr ɓad sayidɗa ɓa na nda fǝr yiɓǝdna ka sataka a Faara. Nduwus ɓen mǝrrǝna ɓa. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Yanɗi ngga, ngwalangɗi tarɗi ndeena Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti a ǝnee, tǝ ƙǝm ƙǝs ɗi fǝrƙǝkafekkid na ha. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Nanǝnya ƙǝna tarna a ƙǝla nggi fa, ƙǝna ǝna ˈya na mid Faara, ɓana Chinǝm, tǝ ngwa kumad ƙǝkafek fǝreerha a farɗi. Ƙǝna ɗi ya mbǝ a nggi katenna wa, amma a fingya heu na a ƙǝla ɓadghǝn fa ɓa.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nggǝl mii laɓar Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Ndeng yidwa ɓa wal nggi wet. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Mal Ndemas nggi ɗǝɗǝ Tasalonika ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr nggǝmɗǝ ǝn ƙǝshiirha. Ƙǝresen ɗǝɗǝ Nggalatiya ɗǝ, tǝ ƙǝm Titus ɗǝɗǝ Ndalmatiya ɗǝ. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Ƙǝl Luka kee ndǝna a thlǝmadna. A nanna a ɓarha ɓa tahang Markus ha ɓa, ƙǝsǝr ɓanǝn ɗeesǝ ahu tarna. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Thlǝnɗi Tikikus a Afisa ɗǝ. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />A nanna a ɓarha ɓa tahee luwud mbinna ha ɓa malni a har Karbus a Toruwas. Tǝ ƙǝm tahang ɗeleewar yina ha ɓa, mbǝ ƙǝla fingyayini na chireelth yighǝn ahu pama wa. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Aledzanda tǝɓǝla hukɗǝ nggi kaan. Chinǝm ɓanǝn ngwang kumarha sǝ aten ˈya ǝnanǝn. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Kwaru wun, ƙǝsǝr tsanɗǝ tsahannǝm ha aten Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="2TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />A farɗi ˈwa nanda ɓarha tǝ nggi a thlǝma tǝ ngwa kumarha ɓa, mbǝ niifa sǝ a samadna wa. Kowunni malɗǝ nggi. Niya hwan Faara a kirasang ɗǝ tur ǝnɗi mbǝrna nda fa ya aten ndan wa. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Amma Chinǝm Yeeso ishɗǝ tǝ nggi fǝree kanglanggirha nǝn, a pǝr Laɓara ni na Mbǝnggǝn ngga tǝna fingya mbuwa Yahudaya heu sǝkƙǝn. Hǝryegha Ƙǝrǝsti a mii lǝfariya. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Na Chinǝm a hǝryerha ahu tar mbǝlfeerha heu, nǝn a tǝreerha ɗǝ tǝ sammayirha ahu Kutǝryidghǝn ɗǝ a talara. Mamnggirha heu yi Faara ni pakwanɗǝ. Atsaukake.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwala mii nda ǝn Mbulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Ndangˈya Mbǝriskila fa, tǝ Akila tǝ minda Onesiforus. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Na Arastus a Koronti, malyi Tǝrufemus fadghǝn ɓee a Miletus. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ɓoɓa wet kapa ndǝri mbiirha tsǝrha hai. Nda Yubulus, tǝ Fudens, tǝ Lainus, tǝ Kaludiya heu tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso kanda a ndo ˈya fa. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />A tsauka Chinǝm tǝ sǝsǝnwa ha, tǝ ƙǝm nggayidghǝn a tsauka tǝ kun heu.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>